Subject: fix: CHANGE is left out while trapped; CATCH where no ball can work
 (#5)

- CHANGE is not shown while the Pokemon cannot be switched out (Wrap, Bind,
  Mean Look, Ingrain, Shadow Tag, Arena Trap, Magnet Pull: the engine's own
  checks). Pressing A after CHANGE used to go round "can't be switched out!"
  for ever.
- CATCH is not shown against the Pokemon Tower ghost (every ball is dodged)
  or when the party and every PC box are full (it only beeped).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

diff --git a/src/little_trainers_battle_ui.c b/src/little_trainers_battle_ui.c
index 43f4cf652..d5202c830 100644
--- a/src/little_trainers_battle_ui.c
+++ b/src/little_trainers_battle_ui.c
@@ -5,8 +5,10 @@
 #include "battle_message.h"
 #include "data.h"
